{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun and casualthird-person shooting game. You can not only defeat opponents with weapons, but bullets can also <strong>modify the properties of almost any object in the scene, even the players themselves</strong>, helping you turn the tide in battle mode or find the exit in challenge mode! At the same time, in battle mode you can <strong>accumulate chances to draw cards, collect them to unlock various buffs and skills</strong>, and define your unique playstyle! The game features multiple maps, modes, items, characters, and weapons, offering a rich and diverse gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Refreshing Shooting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a head-lock auto-aim system, you can shoot freely without precise aiming! Ensuring every player starts fairly and enjoys smooth gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.mp4?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the attributes of any object on the map (including enemies and yourself), such as position, size, rotation, voltage, and more to create tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.mp4?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/f2104da5fb6d41ce9c8bcf622735bcaa.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/f2104da5fb6d41ce9c8bcf622735bcaa.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/f2104da5fb6d41ce9c8bcf622735bcaa.mp4?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scene Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, create, and duplicate objects and buildings in the scene to construct your own defensive fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/8ddd6c98ad148b6a67009bd45e30f4ff.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/8ddd6c98ad148b6a67009bd45e30f4ff.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/8ddd6c98ad148b6a67009bd45e30f4ff.mp4?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Upgrades:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain cards through battles to unlock buffs and skills, and build your unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/188bad64f79d7dcd47bb64eb543793c3.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/188bad64f79d7dcd47bb64eb543793c3.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/188bad64f79d7dcd47bb64eb543793c3.mp4?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-player Challenges:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t like PvP battles? The game also features brain-teasing challenge modes! Use attribute adjustments to solve puzzles and race against players worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/233a7ceee243a503fe7637d648e88c1c.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/233a7ceee243a503fe7637d648e88c1c.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/233a7ceee243a503fe7637d648e88c1c.mp4?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2817420?t=1759021478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2817420?t=1759021478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/4130f471717a93ac5cdc9360842f6fd934385ef6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759021478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/4130f471717a93ac5cdc9360842f6fd934385ef6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759021478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3982590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun and casualthird-person shooting game. You can not only defeat opponents with weapons, but bullets can also <strong>modify the properties of almost any object in the scene, even the players themselves</strong>, helping you turn the tide in battle mode or find the exit in challenge mode! At the same time, in battle mode you can <strong>accumulate chances to draw cards, collect them to unlock various buffs and skills</strong>, and define your unique playstyle! The game features multiple maps, modes, items, characters, and weapons, offering a rich and diverse gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Refreshing Shooting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a head-lock auto-aim system, you can shoot freely without precise aiming! Ensuring every player starts fairly and enjoys smooth gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.poster.avif?t=1759021478\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.webm?t=1759021478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src